# Platform Control Center — web shell (P1 EPIC C)

## Host

Platform ops UI is served on **platform admin host** only:

| Host | Surface |
|------|---------|
| `admin.{PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN}` | Platform Control Center |
| `{club}.admin.{root}` | Club operator panel (unchanged) |

Detection: `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` (`parseMultiLevelTenantHost`, `isPlatformAdminHost`) via `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-multi-level-host.ts` and `is-platform-admin-host.ts`. Dev: `admin.localhost`; prod: `admin.{PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN}`.

See [`platform-host-multilevel.mdoc`](platform-host-multilevel.mdoc) for full host matrix and middleware isolation.

Ops (domains, health, audit): [`platform-control-center-ops.mdoc`](platform-control-center-ops.mdoc).

P2-B support impersonation (Owner tab · operator banner): [`platform-impersonation.mdoc`](platform-impersonation.mdoc).

P2-C billing tab: [`platform-billing-plans.mdoc`](platform-billing-plans.mdoc).

P2-D domains SSL badges + overview KPI: [`platform-domains-ssl.mdoc`](platform-domains-ssl.mdoc).

P2-E actions danger zone + audit CSV: [`platform-offboard-compliance.mdoc`](platform-offboard-compliance.mdoc).

P2-A platform gateway (apex/www): [`platform-mother-site.mdoc`](platform-mother-site.mdoc).

Middleware branches on platform host **before** club operator session checks.

## Route map

| URL | Page |
|-----|------|
| `/platform` | Overview KPIs |
| `/platform/clubs` | Tenant directory |
| `/platform/clubs/new` | Create club wizard |
| `/platform/team` | Platform ops team directory + invite |
| `/platform/workspace-definitions` | Workspace definition list (P3-C) |
| `/platform/workspace-definitions/{id}` | Workspace builder editor (P3-C) |
| `/platform/settings` | Platform settings (placeholder) |
| `/auth/login` | Platform ops OTP login (platform admin host only; shared route file with club login) |

Route group: `apps/web/app/(platform)/` — **no** `denali/ui` imports (PATTERN-C).

Nav SoT: `platform-nav.ts` — all hrefs prefixed `/platform`.

## Session

| Cookie | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `session` | Club operator JWT (unchanged) |
| `platform_session` | Platform ops **signed JWT** (`validatePlatformSessionToken` in middleware) |

Platform login flow: BFF `POST /api/platform/auth/login` → API `POST /platform/v1/auth/verify-otp` → Set-Cookie JWT with **`platform_role` from DB** (never hardcoded owner).

Gate: `requirePlatformOpsSessionWeb` in `(platform)/layout.tsx`.

Login UI: single `app/auth/login/page.tsx` branches on `isPlatformAdminHost(host)` → `pluginId="platform"` vs tenant bootstrap (avoids duplicate Next.js `/auth/login` routes).

## BFF

Browser calls **`/api/platform/*`** only (via `platform-api-client.ts`). BFF proxies to API:

| BFF | Upstream |
|-----|----------|
| `GET /api/platform/workspaces` | `GET /platform/v1/workspaces` |
| `GET /api/platform/tenants` | `GET /platform/v1/tenants` |
| `GET /api/platform/tenants/{id}` | `GET /platform/v1/tenants/{id}` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants` (+ `Idempotency-Key`) |
| `PATCH /api/platform/tenants/{id}/status` | `PATCH /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/status` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/owner-invite` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/owner-invite` |
| `GET /api/platform/team` | `GET /platform/v1/team` |
| `POST /api/platform/team` | `POST /platform/v1/team` (owner only) |
| `POST /api/platform/auth/request-otp` | `POST /platform/v1/auth/request-otp` |

### P3-C BFF routes (workspace builder — planned)

| BFF | Upstream |
|-----|----------|
| `GET /api/platform/workspace-definitions` | `GET /platform/v1/workspace-definitions` |
| `POST /api/platform/workspace-definitions` | `POST /platform/v1/workspace-definitions` |
| `POST /api/platform/workspace-definitions/{id}/versions` | `POST /platform/v1/workspace-definitions/{id}/versions` |
| `GET /api/platform/workspace-definitions/{id}/versions/{version}` | `GET /platform/v1/workspace-definitions/{id}/versions/{version}` |
| `PATCH /api/platform/tenants/{id}/workspace-definition` | `PATCH /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/workspace-definition` |

Nav: `platform-nav.ts` — **Workspaces** → `/platform/workspace-definitions` (insert after Team). Doc SoT: [`platform-workspace-builder.mdoc`](../phase-16/platform-workspace-builder.mdoc).

### P2 BFF routes (enterprise ops)

| BFF | Upstream |
|-----|----------|
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/impersonate` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/impersonate` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/impersonate/end` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/impersonate/end` |
| `GET /api/platform/plans` | `GET /platform/v1/plans` |
| `PATCH /api/platform/tenants/{id}/subscription` | `PATCH /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/subscription` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/subscription/mark-paid` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/subscription/mark-paid` |
| `GET /api/platform/domains/ssl-summary` | `GET /platform/v1/domains/ssl-summary` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/offboard` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/offboard` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/cancel-offboard` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/cancel-offboard` |
| `POST /api/platform/tenants/{id}/export` | `POST /platform/v1/tenants/{id}/export` |
| `GET /api/platform/audit/export` | `GET /platform/v1/audit/export` |

Headers forwarded: `Authorization: Bearer ${PLATFORM_OPS_BEARER_TOKEN}`, `X-Platform-Ops-Phone` from validated JWT claims (`proxy-platform-api.server.ts`).

