## Create club wizard

Route: `/platform/clubs/new` — 4-step client wizard (`useCreateClubWizard`):

| Step | Component | Fields |
|------|-----------|--------|
| 1 Identity | `step-identity` | displayName, subdomain, workspaceType (select from BFF workspaces) |
| 2 Sites | `step-sites` | read-only URL preview (marketing / portal / admin) |
| 3 Owner | `step-owner` | ownerPhone (required) |
| 4 Review | `step-review` | summary + `POST /api/platform/tenants` with `Idempotency-Key` UUID |

Client subdomain rules mirror API (`validate-subdomain.ts`). Success → redirect `/platform/clubs/{tenantId}`.

Async UX: `platform-async-states.tsx` (Loading / Error / Empty).

Smoke: `apps/web/scripts/smoke-platform-create-club.mjs`.

## Team page (EPIC G)

Route: `/platform/team` — server loads members via BFF `GET /api/platform/team`.

| Section | Content |
|---------|---------|
| Member list | phone, role, createdAt |
| Invite form | phone + role select (`admin` / `support`); visible to **owner** session only |

Client component: `src/platform/team/team-invite-form.tsx` posts to `POST /api/platform/team`.

Nav: `platform-nav.ts` includes **Team** → `/platform/team`.

## E2E smoke (EPIC H)

Playwright config: `playwright.platform.config.ts` · specs: `test/e2e/platform-*.spec.ts`.

| Spec | Flow |
|------|------|
| `platform-create-club.spec.ts` | Platform ops login → 4-step wizard → club appears in `/platform/clubs` |
| `platform-owner-handoff.spec.ts` | Provision club → owner invite → club admin OTP login → dashboard |
| `platform-suspend-blocks-login.spec.ts` | Suspend club → operator request-otp **403** `AUTH_TENANT_SUSPENDED` |
| `platform-ops-ui.spec.ts` | §J internal: audit, overview KPI, sites health, domains add, suspend UI, settings |
| `platform-team-invite.spec.ts` | Owner invites platform team member via `/platform/team` |

Extended handoff: `platform-owner-handoff.spec.ts` asserts wizard **Next** control after welcome CTA (minimal §J wizard QA — not tour publish).

### §J internal E2E coverage

| Checklist gap | Proven by |
|---------------|-----------|
| Audit page lists provision events | `platform-ops-ui` → `TENANT_CREATED` row |
| Overview `Total clubs` KPI | `platform-ops-ui` → `[data-stat-total]` ≥ 1 |
| Overview `Unhealthy sites` KPI | `platform-ops-ui` → `[data-stat-unhealthy]` rendered; ≥ 1 when sites check reports `down` |
| Sites health actionable | `platform-ops-ui` → Check health → 3 surface rows |
| Domains tab add hostname | `platform-ops-ui` → hostname in list |
| Suspend via UI | `platform-ops-ui` → Actions → `[data-status=suspended]` |
| Team invite UI | `platform-team-invite` |
| Settings placeholder | `platform-ops-ui` → `[data-platform-settings-page]` |
| Wizard beyond shell | `platform-owner-handoff` → `[data-workspace-wizard]` + `workspace-wizard-step-next` |

**Not in scope (P2):** marketing catalog after publish, portal registration.

### E2E `data-testid` contract

| Surface | Attribute |
|---------|-----------|
| Overview | `data-platform-overview`, `data-stat-total`, `data-stat-unhealthy` |
| Audit | `data-platform-audit-page`, `data-audit-row` |
| Settings | `data-platform-settings-page` |
| Club detail tabs | `data-tab-button={overview\|sites\|domains\|owner\|actions}` |
| Club actions | `data-action-suspend`, `data-action-activate` |
| Sites tab | `data-sites-check-health`, `data-sites-health-results` |
| Team invite | `data-platform-team-invite-form`, `data-platform-team-invite-phone`, `data-platform-team-invite-submit`, `data-client-ready` on form |
| Club detail tabs | `data-tab-button`, `data-client-ready` on `[data-platform-club-detail]` |
 `scripts/smoke-platform-e2e-servers.mjs` (API `:3001` + web `:3000`, `DATABASE_URL` + `DATABASE_URL_ADMIN` required). The script runs **`db:migrate:deploy`** then **`db:seed`** before starting servers so provision saga tables exist and Postgres identity includes the **membership-free invitee user** (`+15550008803`, `OPERATOR_SMOKE_INVITEE_USER_ID`) required for owner-handoff OTP login.

```bash
pnpm run p1:gate
pnpm --filter @apps/web run test:e2e:platform
pnpm --filter @apps/web run test:e2e:platform:install   # chromium once
```

Platform ops session fixture: `test/fixtures/platform-ops-session.ts` (BFF `POST /api/platform/auth/login`, dev OTP `1234`).

**Owner handoff:** provisioned club admin hosts (`{subdomain}.admin.localhost`) resolve tenant via public registry on BFF login; middleware session bind fail-opens for unmapped multi-level club hosts so invite accept does not hit `AUTH_TENANT_HOST_MISMATCH`. See [`platform-host-multilevel.mdoc`](platform-host-multilevel.mdoc) § Session bind vs BFF tenant resolution.

Structural smokes (no Playwright):

```bash
node apps/api/scripts/smoke-platform-provision.mjs --help
node apps/web/scripts/smoke-platform-ui.mjs
```

## Club detail (EPIC D)

Route: `/platform/clubs/[id]` — server loads tenant detail via BFF `GET /api/platform/tenants/{id}`.

| Tab | Content |
|-----|---------|
| Overview | subdomain, workspace, status, createdAt |
| Sites | marketing / portal / admin URLs + **surface enabled badges** (P4-C · [`platform-club-surfaces-config.mdoc`](../phase-17/platform-club-surfaces-config.mdoc)) |
| Owner | pending invite phone + status; **Resend invite** button |
| Actions | Suspend / Activate (`PATCH /api/platform/tenants/{id}/status`) |

Client mutations use `fetchPlatformApi` only. Table rows link to detail (`platform-clubs-table.tsx`).

